<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageId>Barbatos.SecsGem.Recipes</PackageId>
    <TargetFrameworks>$(BarbatosTargetFrameworks)</TargetFrameworks>
    <RootNamespace>Barbatos.SecsGem.Recipes</RootNamespace>
    <PackageTags>secs;e5;stream15;recipe;namespace;transfer;download;upload</PackageTags>
    <Description>Recipe management (SECS-II stream 15) for .NET, both ends: the namespace directory, create and delete, the recipe download in its two transactions, the upload, the delete, the rename, the copy, the lock and unlock, the select, the current recipe and the operation abort. Fourteen of stream 15's twenty-seven pairs - nine whose every field is a defined data item, the recipe body being stream 7's own PPBODY in a row whose siblings the reference documented, and four that carry one undefined name each. Those four are served because of where the name sits: RCPIDNEW, RCPSPECDST and RCPIDDST each extend a defined name two positions earlier in the same body, and RCPLOCKID is a lock token the machine mints and reads back, carried as the item that arrived. The other fourteen pairs stay out, mostly on names whose nearest definition disagrees about the format. Two stores: one in memory, and one that keeps each recipe in a file - written through and renamed into place, with the namespace and identifier inside the record rather than in the file name - so the recipes, the namespaces, the locks and the selection are still there after a power cut and a host does not send a recipe twice. Depends on Barbatos.SecsGem.Hsms, not on GEM: stream 15 is no part of SEMI E30.</Description>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- Referenced directly: the DI extension and the logging both ends take are used here, and a
         transitive reference through Hsms is not a promise this project should rely on. -->
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\src\Barbatos.SecsGem.Core\Barbatos.SecsGem.Core.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\src\Barbatos.SecsGem.Hsms\Barbatos.SecsGem.Hsms.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
